{
  "_comment": [
    "pipeline-armor severity ratings for Checkov check IDs.",
    "Checkov OSS does not emit severities without a Prisma Cloud API key, so",
    "without this map every finding would be unrated. These are pipeline-armor's",
    "own ratings (not Prisma's). Checks that are not listed get the workflow's",
    "`iac_default_severity` (default: high) so unrated findings fail closed.",
    "Callers can override or extend entries via `checkov_severity_map`."
